  "description": "In every fairy tale, the prince saves the kingdom.\n\nBut who saves the prince?\n\nBehind the crown lies pressure, expectation, and a life chosen for him long before he could choose for himself. Admired by all, yet rarely understood, each prince carries a different burden beneath royal perfection.\n\nPrince Date Diaries: A Fairy Tale Love is a narrative-driven dating visual novel where your choices shape your romance with charming anime princes from rival kingdoms.\n\nAs you grow closer, you’ll uncover hidden doubts, private fears, and feelings that could change more than just a heart, they could change the future of a kingdom.\n\nYou’re not just part of his story.\n\nYou’re the one who sees the man beneath the crown.\n\nWill you follow tradition… or create your own fairy tale ending?\n\n\nFEATURES:\n\n● CHARMING PRINCE CAST: Meet anime princes with unique personalities, royal roles, and emotional depth.\n\n● FAIRY TALE ROMANCE: Experience palace settings, royal balls, secret gardens, and intimate moments.\n\n● CHOICE-DRIVEN STORY: Your decisions influence trust, affection, and the prince’s future.\n\n● MULTIPLE STORY ROUTES: Each prince has branching paths and exclusive romantic scenes.\n\n● DIFFERENT ENDINGS: True love, political alliance, sacrifice, or heartbreak.\n\n● HIGH REPLAY VALUE: Unlock hidden dialogues, special events, and alternative endings.\n\n\nA crown may shape his destiny.\nBut your love could change his story.",
